      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAMIA NONNA MARY (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Traralgon in a handy 19.72 beating Ishikawa Lass. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including three wins, from six starts. Great chance again. BLACK MARVEL (3) was in the placings last time but prior to that produced a sharp 25.43 win over 450m at Shepparton. Expected to feature on best figures. PAW QUEBEC (4) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing eighth (30.95) at The Meadows last time. Has a good record at this journey. Key runner on best form. AMRON DANCER (7) placed last time (30.01) at Sandown in a Special conditions H, finishing third and beaten 5.5 lengths. Has already won out of this draw.",
